---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { AUTHOR_NAME, CLARITY_ID, CONTACT_EMAIL, GA4_ID, LAST_UPDATED, LEGAL, SITE_NAMES, SITE_URL } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title={`Legal notice – ${SITE_NAMES[lang]}`} description="Publisher, publication director, host, purpose of the site, no paperwork service offered, reuse of official texts, liability and governing law for Carte Grise Juste." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Legal notice' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Legal notice</h1>
    <p>Information published under article 6 III-1 of French law no. 2004-575 of 21 June 2004 on confidence in the digital economy.</p>
    <h2>Publisher</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang={lang} />
    <p>Publication director: {AUTHOR_NAME}, responsible for the content published on {SITE_URL}.</p>
    <h2>Host</h2>
    <LegalIdentity mode="hosting" lang={lang} />
    <h2>Purpose of the site</h2>
    <p>The site works out, free of charge, an estimate of the cost of a French registration certificate from the visitor’s inputs and explains the rules behind it. It is not approved to carry out registration procedures, does not offer them and acts for no one: the application is made on the website of the French secure documents agency (ANTS), free of charge, with only the taxes to pay. The site is independent of the ANTS, the Ministry of the Interior and the regional councils, and uses none of their logos. Method and limits: <a href={route('method', lang)}>calculation method</a>.</p>
    <h2>Official texts reused</h2>
    <p>Rules and scales come from texts published on Légifrance, service-public.gouv.fr guidance and regional council resolutions, cited page by page. Public information is reused under the <a href="https://www.etalab.gouv.fr/licence-ouverte-open-licence" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Etalab open licence</a> where it applies, with source and date.</p>
    <h2>Liability</h2>
    <p>Scales are reread and tested, with no guarantee that they are error-free or updated the instant a region votes. The publisher cannot be held liable for a decision taken solely on an estimate shown here; the amount the ANTS calculates when you apply is the one that counts. Report an error through the <a href={route('contact', lang)}>contact</a> page.</p>
    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>Texts, graphics and code are protected and remain the publisher’s property; short quotations are allowed with a link to the original page.</p>
    <h2>Embedding the calculator</h2><p>The calculator may be embedded free of charge in an iframe, keeping the visible link: see the <a href={route('widget', lang)}>widget page</a>.</p>
    {/* gen-legal-pages:terms */}
    <h2>Personal data and cookies</h2>
    {GA4_ID ? (<p>What you type in the calculators stays in your browser. The site sets Google Analytics audience measurement cookies (<code>_ga</code>, <code>_ga_{GA4_ID.replace('G-', '')}</code>, 13 months at most), with no advertising{CLARITY_ID && '; page stability is monitored with Microsoft Clarity, cookie-free'}. Details, legal basis and how to object: <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a> page.</p>) : (<p>What you type in the calculators stays in your browser and the site sets no cookies{CLARITY_ID && '; page stability is monitored anonymously with Microsoft Clarity, cookie-free'}. See the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and the <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a> page.</p>)}
    {/* /gen-legal-pages:terms */}
    <h2>Reporting</h2><p>Unlawful content: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>, with the page address and the reason.</p>
    <h2>Governing law</h2><p>French law. Failing an amicable settlement, the competent courts of {LEGAL.jurisdiction}. Updated: {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
